  "title": "Vishnu V Probable NDE 6879",
  "date": "I don't really remember the date. it happened when I was in my sixth class",
  "content": "Honestly, I have a really poor memory. As far as I remember, I had a small argument with my mother. I was frustrated by not being heard by anyone. I went into the bathroom, took my towel and rolled it. I pulled as hard as I could. Without even bothering about my losing or fluctuating breath I held the towel tight and firm. When I regained consciousness, I was resting my head beside the toilet seat. The water dripping from the tap beside it awakened me. I strongly believe I heard someone speak to me. I don't remember what he spoke or what I heard; but I was sure. He had a firm voice of an average man in his mid-40s, he had a high base: the voice still rings in my ears but the words unclear.",
